{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/c5ce0eccc1c6a97c180fc972b00496e3.avif?t=1762167588\" width=1463 height=436 /></span><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dire circumstances see <strong>Boy</strong> running from home with shady figures on his tail. Avoid capture and meet mysterious personalities - through caves, mountains and mysterious facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find a safe way home, or fall victim to mishap and destruction, even the dangers of <i>gambling</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homeshift</strong>\u00a0is built around tight platforming controls and a player driven sandbox, with diverse tools to solve your problems in creative ways. Explode tough enemies with powerful bombs, climb over obstacles with ropes, or binge drink your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.poster.avif?t=1762167588\" width=716 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.webm?t=1762167588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.mp4?t=1762167588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic games like <i>Kye</i>, <strong>Homeshift</strong> uses a custom Game Engine built from the ground up with modding support in mind. Creating new levels, campaigns and art assets is a breeze utilising the <strong>Tiled</strong> editor and our provided plugins.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863240?t=1762167588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863240?t=1762167588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/7c7e1cea8e5d91f0aeccf306509452c7edad883c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762167588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/7c7e1cea8e5d91f0aeccf306509452c7edad883c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762167588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3957120,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/c5ce0eccc1c6a97c180fc972b00496e3.avif?t=1762167588\" width=1463 height=436 /></span><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dire circumstances see <strong>Boy</strong> running from home with shady figures on his tail. Avoid capture and meet mysterious personalities - through caves, mountains and mysterious facilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find a safe way home, or fall victim to mishap and destruction, even the dangers of <i>gambling</i>?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Homeshift</strong>\u00a0is built around tight platforming controls and a player driven sandbox, with diverse tools to solve your problems in creative ways. Explode tough enemies with powerful bombs, climb over obstacles with ropes, or binge drink your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.poster.avif?t=1762167588\" width=716 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.webm?t=1762167588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/extras/dbbd1177205d5bafbe7b8f321c624b5c.mp4?t=1762167588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic games like <i>Kye</i>, <strong>Homeshift</strong> uses a custom Game Engine built from the ground up with modding support in mind. Creating new levels, campaigns and art assets is a breeze utilising the <strong>Tiled</strong> editor and our provided plugins.</p>","developers":["Harjutales"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863240/d1ae29b77b34eddb0a3b4884bdd3afee93de0219/header.jpg?t=1762167588","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863240/451835638/37c3e5774be660047384c5ed5978a65b55fa8cbf/1759773539/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759786212","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863240/451835638/37c3e5774be660047384c5ed5978a65b55fa8cbf/1759773539/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759786212","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3863240/451835638/37c3e5774be660047384c5ed5978a65b55fa8cbf/1759773539/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759786212","id":257213135,"mp4":{